+ * laurel 2950 (Mi A3 dual boot, docs/laurel_sprout/dual-boot.md): the root is the GPT partition iosroot on LUN 0, nothing else. ufs_write_blocks refuses every block outside it.
+ * No iosroot, or a GPT with an unexpected layout, or no HFS+ volume in it: no block goes out at all.
  */
 #if defined(ARM64_BOARD_CONFIG_SWEET)
